      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然赛程安排得相当勉强，\n但这是我们两人商量后作出的决定。目的只有一个，\n『确认莱茵力量的实力』――",
      "source_fingerprint": "c6dcf3c21af76d511ff9f8edb0d6ac64c7ce928829c96eef4f22b14bbd73c62e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
