      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "即使她不会参加『橡树大赛』……\n到了秋季，莱茵同学很可能在『秋华赏』\n重新回到后冠路线。",
      "source_fingerprint": "58cb6fc7f0d947b507eb47f991014bf94dd4fa1272b75dbdc1546ae7aecc5378",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
