      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "上一场『樱花赏』中，莱茵同学便跑得十分强势，\n仿佛在宣告英里赛才是属于自己的舞台。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5d5eb3da6b223bcac8e8126313c99adfbe4a0556a4586a47f8a191a371e73879",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
