      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "从后冠路线转战『NHK英里赛』\n并赢得胜利的赛马娘，至今尚未出现。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b4b33913139cbc4417bf61af169c4e760bef27e1f6b71ef7f9332fe288af390a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
