    {
      "uid": "zhcn:980f97b95a51dd571c05029b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "NHK英里赛，无论走三冠路线・后冠路线\n同世代所有速度出众的赛马娘，都会齐聚一堂，\n是要在英里赛程决出最强者的比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "99eca746475889f0092239dfa578dd10f183434245be4b411f30c839762eea40",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111202.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab08194800971dc69cc4b9dc",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "空中救世主",
      "source_fingerprint": "44b0b4536a8618f87e6f59f3e688bdf6df0281db1545eb55578e92f69875751b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
