    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b7c85d8df316b7b22f60d86",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "很可能正是如此。……她并非会不加考虑，\n便发起鲁莽挑战的人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f426f7fe09397123ae5fbd21617acf6e6d4aeb100580f05edd61e9c1594b084",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
