    {
      "uid": "zhcn:10e9ec943bf42b1b0a90464d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "那般憧憬后冠的她……\n没有选择『橡树大赛』而是选择『NHK英里赛』，\n正在刻下属于自己的蹄印。",
      "source_fingerprint": "20cdd812c612a6335f3ced8808ec4c8b026406153fc066a51e70ce9f674058c3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111202.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        9,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/9/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47e9dd15f28283d1be18863c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "迎接NHK英里赛",
      "source_fingerprint": "02f29e95e0d2f617742b512f3bff95d1313486524ca776a2cd0c65be00d22d53",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111202.json",
      "json_path": [
        "title"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/title"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6145381e906b247429c161df",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "终于，迎来了三后冠第二战\n『橡树大赛』当天。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2451b1a6648132b69ee40121b941e226c601a649681da4c802643f5d31968b95",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111203.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        0,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/0/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9f8cca9820f198ae8deacd5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "空中救世主也完成了平常的放松流程，\n做好了一切准备――",
      "source_fingerprint": "3998759cc097beaeed4a0189b779fc3d7eed5391fe2c8890f44d282bafa74b1b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111203.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        1,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/1/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8223c9f916f133e906a7063",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "西沙里奥的最后3浪……\n也就是最后600米的成绩，几乎每场比赛\n都在所有参赛者中位居第一。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3bc726e552f2f4d69c0cb7f23a519778e7d2d58fa995878091183ab55948cad",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111203.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90b6df1917130d26ec5f20ec",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "空中救世主",
      "source_fingerprint": "44b0b4536a8618f87e6f59f3e688bdf6df0281db1545eb55578e92f69875751b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111203.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d58a2fcfbb302b0ea57c121e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "莱茵力量同学的成长速度，\n远远超出了我们的想象。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c305e0046cc34fb00cbbdbd6dc35ef49513af1e4523fc71f25d6942b0f18d409",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111203.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        11,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/11/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bd86135fe8103281601c903b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "空中救世主",
      "source_fingerprint": "44b0b4536a8618f87e6f59f3e688bdf6df0281db1545eb55578e92f69875751b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111203.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7e43121edb01d2525ee6c30",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "既然如此，西沙里奥同学恐怕也一样。\n……我认为应该这样考虑。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4007bd55a3c52a2ea02dd9ee6136d0cd35dd7d2f08d48c83f65e1e4745fc43f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111203.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:42041741214b400ab036a2df",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "是啊，那么――",
      "source_fingerprint": "1f846fbc4ebfcf2feb1bdce436fc9346c2b632cd1ad077ca9c19c165c3d8d1ae",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111203.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ad7bf29ce7a3031c0d2595a3",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "空中救世主",
      "source_fingerprint": "44b0b4536a8618f87e6f59f3e688bdf6df0281db1545eb55578e92f69875751b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111203.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:916c7e3d322dd6ff2501b5da",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "毕竟，她同样是出类拔萃的――\n怪物般的存在，啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6b54ed788b368c8fb5ca29dde0e662b52e54dd98b724e565dcd64951aa709c8",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111203.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78883fb6404a85331ce354e2",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我更新了『对手数据分析_42』里的，\n西沙里奥数据。\n再依据模拟赛成绩等计算预测值――",
      "source_fingerprint": "b6540828ff1ace2a62a1591b2025ac138c30ff82f30107a8451db1d0d6d4423c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111203.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        14,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/14/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:611bb87c82055de4beb584da",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不过……目前的课题还是耐力吧",
      "source_fingerprint": "f3999f22fde06b766a672915991725f154e4f754d4d0836f89be850e0f8438d2",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111203.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        15,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6145970fe19051e07256a729",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "随后把记录空中救世主自身能力的资料，\n同『技能图表分析_51』加以比较。\n为了『橡树大赛』，该磨炼什么……。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b68d406881dbebb424e2adb4fc7a26318f16f138ff73db2798f7058160310632",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111203.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        15,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/15/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:27faeb7b5f93025ca76883f4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "空中救世主",
      "source_fingerprint": "44b0b4536a8618f87e6f59f3e688bdf6df0281db1545eb55578e92f69875751b",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111203.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ff3ca7f70d26e6250e7e6e4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "！……是这样吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "2cc56b9aade7c267ba2ec1bc43f714195e16e39ca7b773aeeaf1915ea3da479d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111203.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        16,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/16/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eaf0c57b953f5bd05ced7cdb",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我一边点头，一边展示各项数据。\n西沙里奥的末段冲刺固然极具威胁……\n但也不能只顾警惕这一点。",
      "source_fingerprint": "68e6d958629228835cbe4773bbc1eca7026a12cf0d2378b508006b57ad712fb0",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111203.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        17,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/17/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f3bdfa6c9082f915c236d37c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "所以，我们要以强化这一部分为目标――",
      "source_fingerprint": "d551eedd4b10a9e0b1d39d6f5168af85a7ebe50ea1e476ded440ef7eedd48537",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111203.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        18,
        "choice_data_list",
        0
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/18/choice_data_list/0"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b828acf3c8ab7db769439635",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最重要的前提是，『橡树大赛』比起『樱花赏』\n距离足足延长了800米，这一点。换言之，\n它要求参赛者拥有极为强韧的身体。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d238c864c39debf778d95af7e448dd88b6177b0f51f9fae1f203de94e85f4106",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1111/storytimeline_501111203.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        18,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/18/text"
    },
    {
